{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x2d9e79",
      "back_en": "we only have moments until a patrol passes by here.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate; added 'aqui' is harmless."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d9ed2",
      "back_en": "planned. Can you take care of the rest?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da10f",
      "back_en": "Oshtor without anyone finding us...? I think that's it?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmentary source rendered faithfully."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da1fa",
      "back_en": "Those two should be able to take care of it.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da3c6",
      "back_en": "Don't worry (plural).",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Plural form, fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da402",
      "back_en": "of anything we do.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da666",
      "back_en": "Didn't expect it to work THAT well. Damn.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Tone preserved."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da693",
      "back_en": "A warning.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da6cd",
      "back_en": "wander, you may never return to reality.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da7d7",
      "back_en": "Why don't you admit your crimes,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da802",
      "back_en": "Lord Ukon?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source says 'Oshtor' but target uses 'Ukon'; name mismatch."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da839",
      "back_en": "Staying silent won't help your cause.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da86a",
      "back_en": "We serve a different general, but all of us",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'looked up' verb dropped; 'todos nós' alone loses meaning."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da89f",
      "back_en": "to you. Please, do not disgrace yourself further.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da8d1",
      "back_en": "...I'm afraid this must continue, then. As long as",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da906",
      "back_en": "you stay silent, you will be whipped and lashed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da937",
      "back_en": "If you won't tell us where Lady Honoka",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Split line, faithful."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da967",
      "back_en": "is hidden, we'll make her reveal herself.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'we will make you' refers to forcing the prisoner; target makes Honoka reveal herself—wrong referent."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da989",
      "back_en": "I suggest you prepare--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daa58",
      "back_en": "We arrived in the middle of Oshtor's interrogation.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daacf",
      "back_en": "goes towards Oshtor. Quickly I grab her by the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Split line, faithful."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dab2a",
      "back_en": "Don't be an idiot! If we make noise now,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'make a scene' as 'fizermos barulho' acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dabea",
      "back_en": "Has he revealed the location of the vixen yet?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'vixen' as 'raposa' fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dac44",
      "back_en": "No matter how much pain you/they cause him,",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source 'we cause' shifted to 'causem' (they/you), losing first-person voice."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dac83",
      "back_en": "I suppose we should have expected such resolve",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'resolve' as 'resolução' acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dacb4",
      "back_en": "of Lord Oshtor...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dacf2",
      "back_en": "trembling as Vurai looks at them—eyes ablaze.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'glares' softened to 'olha' but acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dad49",
      "back_en": "Vurai coldly looks at the chained Oshtor,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'bound' as 'acorrentado' acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dad8c",
      "back_en": "...The man I once considered my equal has fallen",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dadcb",
      "back_en": "Aagh...Vurai...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dadda",
      "back_en": "What is it...? Begging for your life now?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dae04",
      "back_en": "Her Highness... Is she safe...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dae26",
      "back_en": "How is she... her condition...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dae43",
      "back_en": "You... You still utter these absurd pretenses!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dae75",
      "back_en": "She is safe because YOU locked her in here with me!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Meaning reversed: source says YOU have been locked in here; target says you locked her here with me."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daeb0",
      "back_en": "How long do you intend to continue this",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daeee",
      "back_en": "Why did you not use the power of the Akuruka to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daf20",
      "back_en": "escape capture? A man of your ability could",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daf62",
      "back_en": "...It is simple.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daf73",
      "back_en": "I have no reason to run or hide.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daf94",
      "back_en": "Still you persist in this facade of loyalty?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dafc3",
      "back_en": "Do you intend for your death to prove your",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daffb",
      "back_en": "Words are not necessary. My life belongs to the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db02d",
      "back_en": "imperial house... I remain loyal to Her Highness.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db05f",
      "back_en": "Laughable. And what do you believe can come of that?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db094",
      "back_en": "Guilty or innocent, I have no reason to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db0c5",
      "back_en": "pledge my loyalty to a girl as weak as she!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db0f1",
      "back_en": "Vurai... have you gone mad...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db112",
      "back_en": "Such a statement is treachery to the throne...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db154",
      "back_en": "Silence! Our glorious liege has passed on.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db21c",
      "back_en": "And so you propose to take on that task...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db252",
      "back_en": "Vurai.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db259",
      "back_en": "No! Only the heavens decide who reigns supreme!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db28c",
      "back_en": "But a girl of such weakness will never be the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db2c4",
      "back_en": "Oshtor, know that the truly strong",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db2f9",
      "back_en": "are the truly righteous!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db37e",
      "back_en": "Vurai... why? Why has a man like you--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db3aa",
      "back_en": "Has our liege's death... corrupted you so...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'twisted' as 'corrompeu' acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db4c0",
      "back_en": "prison. Without your Akuruka, you have no escape.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db52f",
      "back_en": "Stop... Vurai! You dare--How dare you--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Minor reorder, meaning preserved."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db557",
      "back_en": "Her Highness--Ngh...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db5e1",
      "back_en": "By the gods... that guy is scary as hell...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Holy shit' softened but tone kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db86e",
      "back_en": "voice!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2db876",
      "back_en": "How did--Where did you all come from!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d9b97",
      "back_en": "bars that keep anyone from going further.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2d9e47",
      "back_en": "Haku, I think we don't have much time. It may be that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da253",
      "back_en": "Are you really serious...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2da42a",
      "back_en": "Shinonon suddenly moves away from Kiwru and walks",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2dab71",
      "back_en": "Mngh! Mmmf!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopoeia, fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2daf52",
      "back_en": "I escaped easily.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Matches."
    }
  ],
